{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Demo Content</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo of <strong>Spaceman Memories</strong> gives players access to the opening chapter of the adventure. You can:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the first town and surrounding areas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the full battle system with turn-based combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet the first set of characters and see the beginning of their story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the first dungeon and solve the first set of puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to the first set of original songs from the full original soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963110/extras/43aeb823a1b87748d93efac3b2765f99.poster.avif?t=1756330014\" width=780 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963110/extras/43aeb823a1b87748d93efac3b2765f99.webm?t=1756330014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963110/extras/43aeb823a1b87748d93efac3b2765f99.mp4?t=1756330014\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a futuristic Japan overrun by spirits, <strong>Spaceman Memories</strong> is a true ode to classic JRPGs of the past. The game's world coupled with its heartwarming narrative, offer players a chance to relive the good old days of 2D gaming. As the spaceman Ichiro 94, whose capsule mysteriously landed back home after a space mission, players embark on a poignant journey of self-discovery, encountering strange creatures, and battling formidable foes, all while uncovering the secrets of his forgotten past and ancient Japanese mysticism. With each step, players must also solve puzzles and use Ichiro's abilities to fight, all of which are vital in the quest to uncover the truth about his past. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963110/extras/47952605b427a3aa428cf920f06bdde4.poster.avif?t=1756330014\" width=734 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963110/extras/47952605b427a3aa428cf920f06bdde4.webm?t=1756330014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963110/extras/47952605b427a3aa428cf920f06bdde4.mp4?t=1756330014\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a beautifully crafted retro Japanese game, brought to life in a vibrant 3D world brimming with emotion and nostalgia. This heartwarming adventure, seamlessly blends open-world exploration with puzzles and turn based battles offering a truly unforgettable experience! </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in epic, story-driven exploration and masterfully crafted turn-based battles in a classic JRPG experience. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a captivating journey through a world inspired by ancient Japanese folklore, brought to life in hand-crafted 3D pixel art. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deep and emotional storyline that explores themes of memory, identity, and the painful realities of loss. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of quests and challenging boss battles offering an engaging nostalgic experience </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through diverse environments ranging from futuristic cities to long-forgotten dungeons to magical forests. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An original soundtrack made with nostalgic synths that perfectly capture the game's retro atmosphere </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3963110?t=1756330014","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3963110?t=1756330014","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963110/a25d0238acf94f0e2cfe47c4c8ee1947585a4ea0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756330014","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963110/a25d0238acf94f0e2cfe47c4c8ee1947585a4ea0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756330014","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Demo Content</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo of <strong>Spaceman Memories</strong> gives players access to the opening chapter of the adventure. You can:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the first town and surrounding areas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the full battle system with turn-based combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet the first set of characters and see the beginning of their story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the first dungeon and solve the first set of puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to the first set of original songs from the full original soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963110/extras/43aeb823a1b87748d93efac3b2765f99.poster.avif?t=1756330014\" width=780 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963110/extras/43aeb823a1b87748d93efac3b2765f99.webm?t=1756330014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963110/extras/43aeb823a1b87748d93efac3b2765f99.mp4?t=1756330014\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a futuristic Japan overrun by spirits, <strong>Spaceman Memories</strong> is a true ode to classic JRPGs of the past. The game's world coupled with its heartwarming narrative, offer players a chance to relive the good old days of 2D gaming. As the spaceman Ichiro 94, whose capsule mysteriously landed back home after a space mission, players embark on a poignant journey of self-discovery, encountering strange creatures, and battling formidable foes, all while uncovering the secrets of his forgotten past and ancient Japanese mysticism. With each step, players must also solve puzzles and use Ichiro's abilities to fight, all of which are vital in the quest to uncover the truth about his past. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963110/extras/47952605b427a3aa428cf920f06bdde4.poster.avif?t=1756330014\" width=734 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963110/extras/47952605b427a3aa428cf920f06bdde4.webm?t=1756330014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963110/extras/47952605b427a3aa428cf920f06bdde4.mp4?t=1756330014\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a beautifully crafted retro Japanese game, brought to life in a vibrant 3D world brimming with emotion and nostalgia. This heartwarming adventure, seamlessly blends open-world exploration with puzzles and turn based battles offering a truly unforgettable experience! </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in epic, story-driven exploration and masterfully crafted turn-based battles in a classic JRPG experience. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a captivating journey through a world inspired by ancient Japanese folklore, brought to life in hand-crafted 3D pixel art. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deep and emotional storyline that explores themes of memory, identity, and the painful realities of loss. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of quests and challenging boss battles offering an engaging nostalgic experience </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through diverse environments ranging from futuristic cities to long-forgotten dungeons to magical forests. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An original soundtrack made with nostalgic synths that perfectly capture the game's retro atmosphere </p></li></ul>","developers":["NerdyPunkDev"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2354580","name":"Spaceman Memories"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963110/e97d478242dbdda39ab2c73a2270ec8157908b6a/header.jpg?t=1756330014","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> SteamOS 3.0 / Linux (Arch, Ubuntu 22.04+, etc.)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Zen 2/AMD Ryzen 3 5300U or Intel Core i5-9400 or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD RDNA2 GPU (Steam Deck) or NVIDIA GTX 1660 / RTX 2060 or AMD RX 6600<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD strongly recommended</li></ul>